ives so all chunk comparisons must also succeed. This reversal isolates the ptr_eq correction. The upstream issue_131 test added by the fix checks that modifying a 65-element clone makes ptr_eq return false.", "updated_at": "2026-09-24T00:19:39.152129+00:00"}
